{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7021c3090600cca6","name":"Miy'til Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-7021c3090600cca6","title":"Miy'til Starfighter","revision":18756,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:40:47Z","sha256":"d7b2e4cfc516111ddfbe11a26efb80d76b779cea4d58ed1daa26dea202b80d2d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18756","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Miy%27til%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7021c3090600cca6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hapes Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hapes_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:91b0af29e731ba94"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Miy'til Starfighter is a small, fast, lightly armed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," built by Olanji/Charubah for use by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hapes Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hapes_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:91b0af29e731ba94"},". The manufacturer enjoys great support from the Hapan royal family, guaranteeing that no other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," is constructed in large numbers within the Consortium. Of course, that protection lasts only as long as the Miy'til Starfighter is seen as a quality product worthy of the Hapan tradition of beauty and excellence. Although it's true that Olanji/Charubah goes to great lengths to polish and decorate every Miy'til Fighter, it also constantly reevaluates the design to ensure that it remains current with other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Because of The Hapes Consortium's long history of isolationism, it's impossible to say exactly when the first Miy'til Starfighter first entered service, but it's certain to be after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},". Many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," engineers fled the losing side of that conflict, and it seems likely that some took refuge in the Consortium and brought their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," design expertise with them. The Miy'til Starfighter is the standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," of all Hapan military units, carried in fair numbers by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hapan Battle Dragons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hapan_Battle_Dragons"}," and smaller ships. Although ",{"tag":"a","children":["X-Wings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/X-Wings"}," are also valued for their better ability to sustain damage, the Miy'til Fighter is piloted with pride by its pilots as proof of Hapan equality with other Starship designers.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Miy'til Starfighter fills its role as a space superiority Starfighter brilliantly. As a small, fast craft, the ship makes it easy for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hapans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hapans?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to get wings of fighters wherever they are needed quickly. Outfitted with a week's worth of supplies and a good ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},", patrols of Miy'til Fighters can sweep through large volumes of space with very little additional support.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The original generation of Miy'til Fighters placed an Astromech Droid in a top-mounted socket, similar to how ",{"tag":"a","children":["ARC-170s"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ARC-170s"}," carry them. Later generations built a fully enclosed compartment for onboard Astromechs, giving them slightly better protection. Many of the older Miy'til Fighters are still in service. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Miy'til Command Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Miy%27til_Command_Starfighters"}," also exist, which add a third ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:0911ab4bc0e93386"},", two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Cannons"},", and a second ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concussion Missile Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concussion_Missile_Launcher"},". Such Command Starfighters are extremely expensive, but highly valued by wing leaders. Members of Hapan noble families often own Miy'til Starfighters that they modify yet further, personalizing them as a sign of rank and wealth.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Miy'til Starfighter Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +10; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 17 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],